  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "This is the last 4th job quest.",
      "you succeed in the 2tests and even got ",
      "the RoyalAmulet.",
      "You must be stronger and physically more ",
      "powerful than me. we will move to a secret ",
      "place in the Kingdom so, give me ",
      "Royal Amulet. You will not get ",
      "the Royal Amulet back so do not regret!",
      "You have to battle with me for the 4th test, ",
      "which is easy.If you fail in this test, ",
      "you have to get another Royal Amulet and ",
      "we do the battle again. Are you ready for it?",
      "Try not to have a difficult time and learn ",
      "from your mistake. Moreover, if you fail ",
      "go back to town and visit me again.",
      "",
      "[Job Quest]",
      "Complete your quest by confronting ",
      "the skill Master."
    ]
  },
